{% macro content(spec) %}
{% set spec = spec or {} %}
{% set _class = spec.class or '' %}
{% set _content = spec.content or '{}' %}
{% set _title = spec.title or 'Styleguide' %}
{% block config %}
  {# Correct base url pathing for this page #}
  {% set baseUrl = '../' %}
{% endblock %}
<article class="gallery-text">
  {# ticket 46 / DR-0014: the page opens with the adapted bare hero —
     second instance (visuAI was the first). Transparent on the section's
     light ground, adapted kicker (not "Case Study"), shared spacing/type
     roles. The hero owns the page's single h1. #}
  <div class="case-study document-text">
    <header class="cs-hero">
      <p class="cs-eyebrow">The visualbear System</p>
      {# title param (ticket 6): the `/workflow/` panel renames the page
         h1 to "Design system"; the `/styleguide/` page keeps the default. #}
      <h1>{{ _title }}</h1>
      <p class="cs-cover-summary">A collection of all the individual components and rules
        used to build this site. I use a modified, custom version of
        <a href="http://patternlab.io/" title="Link to Pattern Lab">Pattern Lab's</a> atomic
        design structure, customised by me.</p>
      <p class="cs-cover-details">Design reference ⋅ 2026</p>
    </header>
  </div>
    <p>The structure is divided into:</p>
    <ul class="index">
      <li><a href="#core" onclick="scroller('stylesheet-core')">Core</a></li>
      <li><a href="#modules" onclick="scroller('stylesheet-modules')">Modules</a></li>
      <li><a href="#containers"  onclick="scroller('stylesheet-containers')">Containers</a></li>
      <li><a href="#casesystem"  onclick="scroller('stylesheet-casesystem')">Case-study system</a></li>
      <!--<li><a href="#templates"  onclick="scroller('stylesheet-templates')">Templates</a></li>-->
    </ul>
    <p>The purpose of exposing this styleguide is to present my portfolio itself as part my portfolio work. What you see is what I use as a reference as I build the site, as it's imperative to good web design and development.</p>
    <p>Built using:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/larsonjj/generator-yeogurt" target="_blank">Yeogurt</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://materializecss.com/sass.html" target="_blank">Materialize</a></li>
    </ul>  
  </article>
  {% endmacro %}